## 🚀 Installation et lancement

### Prérequis

- Python 3.11+
- Flutter 3.x
- Node.js 18+
- PostgreSQL
- Un wallet MetaMask configuré sur Polygon Amoy

### Backend Django

```bash
cd backend
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate        # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env         # Remplir les variables
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py runserver
```

### App Flutter mobile

```bash
cd mobile/chaincacao
flutter pub get
flutter build apk --release
```

### Dashboard Flutter web

```bash
cd web-dashboard
flutter pub get
flutter run -d chrome
```

### Site vitrine

```bash
cd site-vitrine
# Ouvrir index.html dans le navigateur
# Ou utiliser Live Server dans VS Code
```

### Blockchain

```bash
cd blockchain
npm install
npx hardhat compile
npx hardhat ignition deploy ignition/modules/LotRegistry.js --network amoy
```

---

## 🔑 Variables d'environnement

Copier `.env.example` en `.env` et remplir :

```
# Django
SECRET_KEY=
DEBUG=True
DATABASE_URL=

# AfricasTalking
AT_USERNAME=
AT_API_KEY=

# Polygon
POLYGON_RPC_URL=https://rpc-amoy.polygon.technology
PRIVATE_KEY=
CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x72c5B32758000C6B6CbA364Cb4ef53aEF92948dc

# JWT
JWT_SECRET=
```

